{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1000_037nao", "source_sha256": "4013efc5a37a5e02858ee6d14bccc320dcb8c05e2be42542f9f096ac23148f6b", "ja": "別にナイショにしてたんとちゃうで！\n私の東京の友達が、バイトしててな。", "zh": "我才不是故意瞒着你呢！\n是我在东京的朋友在打工来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "52d5522db4b821c48c61a06d00d11045e90d77af866a39fc96e6f61d6a39865e", "ja": "それがたまたま、恵美の学校の近くやってん。", "zh": "碰巧就在惠美学校附近。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "a44a24de74c30a64133de501755e846fa8f08e9fe3eb375529c4475bfd0de5b2", "ja": "そそ、学校の最寄りの駅前でさ。\nそれ聞いて、友達と帰りに寄ってみたんだよね♪", "zh": "对对，就在学校最近的车站前嘛。\n听说之后，我就和朋友放学回家时顺道去看看了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b6eb67e090445717109f781f9ea92fdfe67f08b938914564b951d58a03522d02", "ja": "友達のバイト先……学校帰りに……\nえ～、いいな～。わたしもはやく高校生になりたい～！", "zh": "朋友打工的地方……放学回家的路上……\n诶～真好啊～我也想快点成为高中生～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "85136d03cd74a472ea30060e0a8461a840e70ec7bb10fd4f2ff79020f2ce7eb3", "ja": "え、そう？　でもアタシと翼って、2つしか\n違わないし……そんな変わんなくない？", "zh": "诶，是吗？不过我和翼也只差2岁……没差多少吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "abd998be79d80aaaa88af968c1c3caa3b74331b1d0df56f6a87289382fac35cc", "ja": "も～。恵美さんと奈緒さんは、\n高校生だからわからないんですよ～だ。", "zh": "真是的～。惠美和奈绪都已经是\n高中生了，所以才不懂啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c65a7fed91786dcd7d1c48dc01956d667672bce2b3d1323f5579d6e6763f4780", "ja": "わたしの中学、下校の時に\n買い食いするのとか禁止だし……。", "zh": "我读的初中，放学路上\n连买零食吃都禁止……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7eebe2ebcd28a8ef3828581ac9dc5fa2fd390086d50df4f7ea912a178f5d402d", "ja": "どうして中学生って、高校生みたいに\n遊んじゃダメなんだろ？　高校生はいいな～。", "zh": "为什么初中生就不能像高中生那样玩呢？高中生真好啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "156c8ff8e3e19da6bbe6b31c26b46e0c33bb4cdbc072dd8e5cd4bab2617d70d0", "ja": "買い食い禁止……！　せやった、忘れてたわ。\n私の学校もそうやったなぁ。", "zh": "禁止买零食……！对了，我都忘了。\n我们学校也是这样来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1009_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4c807919d84799ecb511846c14574726d8c75981ccce31874e5b3d4f45bdf284", "ja": "お疲れさま。", "zh": "辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "7003b6254ecb21ef6706f492e448995f66d31484cabdeb7a0f64e469fdcc499d", "ja": "お疲れさまですー！\n私たちが最後になっちゃったね、真美。", "zh": "辛苦啦——！\n结果我们成了最后到的呢，真美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "8cd84ea2962720ad713c09b1633617548133385b817f0b06538d726519af4f6c", "ja": "真美、本当は用事があったんだけど……兄ちゃんに、\n「どうしても真美がほしい」って言われたからさ。", "zh": "真美本来有事要做的……但哥哥说“无论如何都想要真美”，所以嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2b0d021aad6cc2c5056b70d7d8408f98c207c795d906407f837d19b9d4f4e66f", "ja": "そんな言い方はしていないけどな……。\n全員揃ってるから、早速始めようか。", "zh": "我可没那么说过……。\n既然大家都到齐了，那就马上开始吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1014_p", "source_sha256": "882d09f2e232dae81aa1dd76c5b3cb9fcf690c526cf185b6c5a18d029c65e541", "ja": "今日集まってもらったのは、今度ファッション誌が\n主催するイベントのゲスト出演についてだ。", "zh": "今天请大家过来，是想谈谈下次由时尚杂志主办的活动邀请我们作为嘉宾出演的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e0226436a4f20f0f5025d0aa3108ef7f7f0349abeee9e7877a155841e906ef3d", "ja": "出演者として、この5人に声がかかった。\nこれが先方からの資料だ。", "zh": "这5人受邀作为出演者参加。这是对方发来的资料。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b6d699210489920b5f2349dabe7d32a18c645c4fcaebe5d75c66ef0b95fdaee6", "ja": "……あれ？　{$P$}さん、\nこのイベントって、もしかして……。", "zh": "……咦？{$P$}先生，\n这个活动该不会是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4603d4abf6f3be2ad3dca80d040f1e5b7a0b2f4e65e608bed511dbb6e990dd62", "ja": "わたしが{$P$}さんに\nナンパされたイベントですか？", "zh": "是我被{$P$}先生\n搭讪的那次活动吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "403ae491cd82b063a144814567e9a305dcebbdb3a8bd95b56318ba3285e1d6f6", "ja": "えーっ！　そうなの、兄ちゃん！？", "zh": "诶——！是这样吗，哥哥！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1019_p", "source_sha256": "455ac90975a9856a69c29a79b6f5556b82b27668e7e8acfbbfb7286d64d92997", "ja": "真美、わかってて言ってるだろ……\nナンパじゃなくてスカウトだ！", "zh": "真美，你是明知故问吧……\n不是搭讪，是发掘新人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1020_p", "source_sha256": "d4c77d5418f1bd059e240fe1446fac919a267c5daf3d8144ac92ad826d6d12c0", "ja": "とはいえ、そんなに前の事じゃないのに、\n何だかちょっと懐かしい感じがするな。", "zh": "话虽如此，明明也没过去多久，\n却总觉得有点怀念啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "68d45afeb3b81df31b71779f1382c5211152ecbee2fd1bb6f7554d9d989c5122", "ja": "このイベントって、中高生に人気あるもんね。\nそっかぁ、翼も出てたんだ～。", "zh": "这个活动在初高中生中很受欢迎嘛。\n这样啊，原来翼也参加过呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1022_037nao", "source_sha256": "adef43fd890de9ab94980e2a539c7bdf3d5b56935efd42f2dbe4cfc21a02b3d7", "ja": "そこからスカウトされて……\nまさに、凱旋公演って感じやんな！　やるやん、翼！", "zh": "从那之后被星探发掘了……\n简直就像凯旋公演一样嘛！干得漂亮，翼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "57bf1ff1fcd4b33c56969e72c16f24f0b3dfaa32cae088ab1db8faf505619684", "ja": "えへへ♪　……わたし、あのショーに出たときは、\n自分がアイドルになるなんて思ってなかったな～。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪……我参加那个秀的时候，根本没想过自己会成为偶像呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d286a325f959d35ef212be74767c81cb39ac84e85d66645509f6ba97461f80d8", "ja": "お店の人にモデルを頼まれて、「カワイイ服が\nたくさん着られるならいいかな」ってだけだったし。", "zh": "当时店里的人请我当模特，我只是想着“如果能穿好多可爱的衣服，那也不错吧”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "46ad387a92cc675542693592684637a74bda134340d09f2655db4eef27bb6548", "ja": "でも今度は、お仕事で出るんですよね！\nなんか、すっごく成長したって感じかも？", "zh": "不过这次是作为工作出场，对吧！总觉得自己好像成长了好多呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1026_p", "source_sha256": "82dc4011e3e79daaf1257ca973cf4417d32ffdf05522e92026f0f9c1d3c1d768", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\n翼の成長した姿を、みんなに見てもらえるといいな。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。\n要是能让大家看到翼成长后的样子就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3f3f2a97db294c531013c4a22f6b20a34404295c0ff263be380020c749d01d1d", "ja": "は～い！", "zh": "好的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1028_012mam", "source_sha256": "22d014eaa5b9e2f7e01e970fe61b553e508510fac0356a6686fca9bac2df2cb9", "ja": "けど、ファッションショーのゲストにオシャレ番長の\n真美を選ぶとは……なかなかやりますなぁ。", "zh": "不过，居然选时尚大将真美来当时装秀的嘉宾……还真有眼光啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1029_005yay", "source_sha256": "db4b3c600156588a4abc35e721352d8710f2093f08d09c5df774c103a2a7c2ba", "ja": "真美がオシャレ番長？\nそうだっけ……？", "zh": "真美是时尚老大？\n是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1030_037nao", "source_sha256": "f81f6d13b23c58ef642c0c9a99ed34dbc0cbb90e9aae874e7fe300b737223a19", "ja": "真美、それを言うなら『Jus-2-Mint』で\nモデルを経験した私を忘れたらアカンで！", "zh": "真美，要说这个的话，可别忘了我还当过『Jus-2-Mint』的模特呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1031_037nao", "source_sha256": "55a73fcb45d33b439cd31d563d432e6d89cb77834b8d2aa9b678ec1973286f83", "ja": "それに、私らには何より……。", "zh": "而且，对我们来说最重要的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1032_020meg", "source_sha256": "c1b8fac5ba07a97d3088757431d91824e0259d3a9a0d91de822e2dabd05169d9", "ja": "え、アタシ？　まあ、ショーに出るのは久々だけど……\nカンは鈍ってないと思うよ。にゃははっ♪", "zh": "诶，我？虽然确实好久没登台了……  \n不过我觉得感觉还没生疏。喵哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1033_012mam", "source_sha256": "84a30645d243b3ff81d8d74f3b5528384e8b8058ac8aeef6b339399cccc4db07", "ja": "ああっ！　そういえばこのメンバー、\n読モ師匠ことめぐちんがいるじゃん！？", "zh": "啊！说起来，这成员名单里不是有读者模特师父，也就是惠惠嘛！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1034_012mam", "source_sha256": "c788e6987f8f6c597ae3ac21f184d2447dd17add2f93a0b0bf8422861164fa2c", "ja": "つまり真美たちにも、めぐちん・なおやんレベルの\nセクシーが求められていると……？", "zh": "也就是说，真美她们也被要求达到惠惠、奈绪奈那种级别的性感……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1035_005yay", "source_sha256": "6aafd377fcbce753235209cc769e0a16b710cf566354661d3547b0480cb296cd", "ja": "ええっ、そうなの！？\n私、セクシーには自信ないかも……。", "zh": "诶诶，是这样的吗！？\n我可能对性感不太有自信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1036_p", "source_sha256": "20b018c7bfc8b7b07544821cf82392c30804fb16624cd0b41bbdb6c328fe2b33", "ja": "あ、そこは安心してくれ。\nステージは、対象の雑誌ごとに分かれているから……。", "zh": "啊，这点你就放心吧。\n舞台会按照对应的杂志分别安排……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1037_p", "source_sha256": "a1e9e7d2d2c424a80b1cbf4e654554a50e81534503e266453f33bfeb0f7f997d", "ja": "翼、やよい、真美は中学生ステージ。\n奈緒、恵美は高校生ステージに出演する事になる。", "zh": "翼、弥生和真美会出演初中生舞台。奈绪和惠美则会出演高中生舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1038_012mam", "source_sha256": "7ffb2e623b08d35a53869674ad3b44a5ba8e1915c567606fbbfeab75fbb42696", "ja": "な～んだ！　一緒じゃないんだ～。", "zh": "原来不是一起上台呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1039_p", "source_sha256": "d4db09865f4fc4dfb57e75a9c1083a78c6f23757c4b02690c904af8332ac7ead", "ja": "当日はTVや雑誌の取材も入る。やよいの出演部分は、\n『中学生ダイアリー』でも使う予定だそうだ。", "zh": "当天会有电视和杂志的采访。弥生出场的部分，\n据说也打算用在《中学生日记》里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1040_005yay", "source_sha256": "838ac06c2664827b5695ae21ea30ffa6767cb5ccff4c5d5bb17e96a6b2a649f0", "ja": "わかりました！　私、オシャレは\nそんなに得意ってわけじゃないですけど……。", "zh": "我知道了！我虽然不太擅长打扮……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1041_005yay", "source_sha256": "803df01c053ffb6a4ce88b749e1941984fc12bee0917fc7d05e83977a10c5dba", "ja": "でも、自分のお仕事をみんなに紹介できるのは、\nとってもうれしいです！　がんばりまーす！", "zh": "不过，能向大家介绍自己的工作，我真的特别开心！我会加油的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1042_p", "source_sha256": "041d12cc2a612ce030b12fb7e746f8383bf6f7b7daa0da1aaa73fa73a23f783e", "ja": "それと、ファッションショーの後には、\n5人でのライブステージもある予定だ。", "zh": "另外，时装秀结束后，预定还会有由5人参加的现场舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1043_p", "source_sha256": "2d7f9f7cd6cb9312875146880ae4682ec912c3fce33b458c95729b3710af3d83", "ja": "せっかくの機会だし、\n新曲を披露しようと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "难得有这样的机会，我想要不要表演一下新歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1044_020meg", "source_sha256": "bd26fd021baa473af3dec704a2fe8f551be1759664ea724c2260c61369bfda47", "ja": "それなら、ひとりしかいないんじゃない？\nなんたって凱旋公演だもん！", "zh": "既然这样，不就只有一个人了吗？\n毕竟这是凯旋公演嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1045_037nao", "source_sha256": "b5a8984e2c35b14477b08620e3352a44a1a204510d4129167e7a331f845eaeea", "ja": "私もそう思います！", "zh": "我也这么认为！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1046_p", "source_sha256": "deddfe10dea3316e45fb3e6b23a8139822c9cf6e878044afe4c0e322ffd844fa", "ja": "ありがとう。\n……そういう訳だ。翼、やってくれるか？", "zh": "谢谢。\n……事情就是这样。翼，你愿意接受吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1047_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ca6e3912ca50a68be23cacadaf520e60a9b1efc81d14389296b341a295bacce8", "ja": "えっ……わ、わたし！？\nでも、いいんですか……？", "zh": "诶……我、我吗！？\n可是，真的可以吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1048_p", "source_sha256": "2b644ea841448e3620f2e1016660514a33005522c505477658742de34dc9ef14", "ja": "皆も言ってくれたとおり、\n今回は翼の凱旋ステージでもある。", "zh": "正如大家所说，\n这次也是翼凯旋归来的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1049_p", "source_sha256": "d665d6955e2b2752e5bce7cf9aac5d703584035af996c8103e8e8747dc7a7734", "ja": "アイドルとして輝いている翼の姿を、\n見せつける絶好の機会だと思うぞ。", "zh": "我觉得这是一个绝佳的机会，向大家展现作为偶像闪耀着的翼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1050_016tsu", "source_sha256": "23c06ac10da9d69692eff1e253cbed649acf1394433a11caea637d4c2c422b4e", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nうう、わかりました！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n呜呜，我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1051_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8ca8370beacefb570531db23f24d7627661e76bad1dbbfd3c1ead3df2a5ec75c", "ja": "ショーも新曲も、わたしがんばる！\nみんなに、すっごいステージを見せちゃうんだから！", "zh": "演出和新歌，我都会加油的！\n一定要让大家看到超棒的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1052_p", "source_sha256": "ee2855f59883fd07e7cf8d6524268725b6d89fc26d70c435cc1d83a8502ae03b", "ja": "翼がやる気になってくれて良かったよ。\nそれじゃ各自、資料に目を通しておいてくれ！", "zh": "翼能打起精神来真是太好了。\n那么，大家先各自看看资料吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1053_012mam", "source_sha256": "7a65640013579046a37d196b9ac19a2a06e225bca1940c987f62e5604c994d0f", "ja": "んー……兄ちゃん。やっぱ真美、\n高校生でいくない？", "zh": "嗯……哥哥。真美果然还是当高中生比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1054_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5a81b19e71870e9c32182ea8ac0bd3bf3e28b4eb9204f2bcd8a974656d102b72", "ja": "えーっ。だったらわたしも、高校生ステージがいい！\n{$P$}さん、ダメ？", "zh": "诶——！那我也想要高中生舞台！\n{$P$}先生，不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1055_005yay", "source_sha256": "dabc554f6007c8d3c20d56ceaf4965b011f72cd18bab3decc838a35184f36c7d", "ja": "真美、翼ちゃんも、{$P$}を\n困らせちゃダメだよ。", "zh": "真美、翼也不可以让{$P$}为难哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1056_005yay", "source_sha256": "3ac2970d9a07b89f8938896520ea3f61b139265ca20cd79512bc1898fcd75250", "ja": "私たちは中学生なんだから、\n中学生ステージをがんばろー！　おー！", "zh": "我们都是初中生嘛，\n就好好在初中生舞台上加油吧——！哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1057_p", "source_sha256": "9dfda37a3a064d5a3b19739feb8bdb3992e49acfb8464c01b183695fc2e7d255", "ja": "そうだな、やよいの言うとおりだ！\n真美も翼も、中学生ステージで頑張ろう！", "zh": "没错，就像弥生说的那样！真美和翼也一起在中学生舞台上加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1058_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8a095ebfde003184556c431ec1e1cc4dd0d964a1b0789fcffdf19cca767097b1", "ja": "は～い。", "zh": "好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1059_012mam", "source_sha256": "8a095ebfde003184556c431ec1e1cc4dd0d964a1b0789fcffdf19cca767097b1", "ja": "は～い。", "zh": "好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_113_1060_p", "source_sha256": "5db8eda9a916e93a91a4692516808fd0eccff5679baec4d9dc66b38bf5ccc326", "ja": "（ファッションショーのステージ……皆が楽しめる、\nオシャレでキラキラなステージにしないとな）", "zh": "（时装秀的舞台……得打造一个时尚又闪耀、让大家都能享受的舞台才行）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
